# Process-level settings for the namazu-elements service. This file is a
# conffile: upgrades preserve local edits.
#
# Deployment configuration (Mongo URI, public URLs, bootstrap admin
# credentials) does NOT belong here - it goes in systemd drop-ins under
# /etc/systemd/system/namazu-elements.service.d/ or in
# /etc/elements/elements.properties.

JAVA_OPTS=""
